This ZIP contains the Gerber files exported from KiCad for JLCPCB upload.

Files included (RS-274X):
- esp32-s3-env-station_F.Cu.gbr
- esp32-s3-env-station_B.Cu.gbr
- esp32-s3-env-station_F.SilkS.gbr
- esp32-s3-env-station_B.SilkS.gbr
- esp32-s3-env-station_F.Mask.gbr
- esp32-s3-env-station_B.Mask.gbr
- esp32-s3-env-station_Edge.Cuts.gbr
- esp32-s3-env-station_Drill.excellon

Notes:
- Board size: 80mm x 60mm
- Units: mm
- Please review Edge.Cuts and keepout areas (antenna region) before upload.

